+## Operators
+
+| Operator | Description |
+|----------|-------------|
+| `+`, `-`, `*`, `/`, `%` | Arithmetic |
+| `<`, `>`, `<=`, `>=`, `==`, `!=` | Comparison |
+| `AND`, `OR`, `NOT` | Logical |
+| `CROSSES OVER`, `CROSSES UNDER` | Crossover detection |
+| `CONTAINS` | String/array containment |
