+## Expressions
+
+- Numbers: `42`, `3.14`
+- Strings: `"hello"`, `'world'`
+- Identifiers: `myVar`, `rsi`, `config.size`
+- Function calls: `RSI(14)`, `EMA(21)`
+- Binary ops: `rsi < 30 AND ema > sma`
+- Unary: `NOT condition`
+- Special: `AI_RESULT` (result of last AI_QUERY)
